      "Adam Pike — 2025–26 Memphis Grizzlies Offence Recap: second side commonly uses 4 throw-and-chase into P&R with 2; third side returns to Top P&R spacing.",
      "FIBA — Telekom Baskets Bonn: Iisalo described early offense generally starting with a drag screen and emphasized rapid side-to-side decisions."
    ],
    "adaptation": "CourtPlay coordinates/timing adapted for animation. 4 is forced to roll/short interior instead of pop because this roster uses non-shooting 4/5."
